WEBVTT

NOTE en_md5 d53eb0ea7bb0ec1daa64bb73829462f2

00:00:00.240 --> 00:00:03.700
Karibu tena. Hadi sasa, kila kitu tulichofanya

00:00:03.720 --> 00:00:06.880
kimeandikwa kwa mtindo wa mstari, ambapo Jiki

00:00:06.920 --> 00:00:10.660
hufuata kila agizo kwa mpangilio kuanzia juu

00:00:10.670 --> 00:00:14.220
hadi chini. Katika kipindi hiki, tutaangalia

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:16.330
jinsi Jiki anavyoweza kuvunja

00:00:16.460 --> 00:00:19.690
mtiririko huu mkali wa juu hadi chini, na hasa jinsi

00:00:19.720 --> 00:00:21.800
tunavyoweza kumwambia Jiki aendeshe

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:24.320
sehemu hiyo hiyo ya msimbo mara nyingi

00:00:24.360 --> 00:00:28.680
mfululizo. Kwa mfano, fikiria uko kwenye

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:31.180
labirinthi na unataka kusonga hatua 10

00:00:31.240 --> 00:00:34.240
mbele. Awali nilikupa kitendakazi cha walk

00:00:34.280 --> 00:00:36.690
kusaidia hili, lakini vipi kama

00:00:36.740 --> 00:00:39.670
hicho hakikuwepo? Vipi kama ungekuwa na

00:00:39.920 --> 00:00:44.700
kitendakazi cha move pekee? Badala ya kuandika move

00:00:44.760 --> 00:00:48.000
mara 10 mfululizo, jambo ambalo hurudia rudia sana,

00:00:48.740 --> 00:00:50.420
tunachohitaji kuweza kufanya

00:00:50.500 --> 00:00:54.000
ni kumwambia: "Jiki, fanya kitu kinachofuata

00:00:54.120 --> 00:00:59.840
nitakachosema mara 10. Move." Ili kufanya hivi

00:00:59.900 --> 00:01:02.320
kwenye msimbo, tunahitaji kuweza

00:01:02.480 --> 00:01:07.300
kutumia keyword yetu ya kwanza, na keyword ni maagizo

00:01:07.340 --> 00:01:10.180
ambayo Jiki anayaelewa. Zinaonekana kidogo

00:01:10.220 --> 00:01:13.980
kama mashine, lakini si mashine. Jiki anapoona

00:01:14.020 --> 00:01:16.460
keyword, hataangalia mashine

00:01:16.500 --> 00:01:18.920
kwenye rafu, badala yake anajua tu

00:01:18.960 --> 00:01:23.300
kwamba afanye jambo fulani. Imejengwa ndani ya ubongo wake. Na

00:01:23.320 --> 00:01:25.700
kuna takriban keyword 20 tofauti ambazo

00:01:25.740 --> 00:01:28.480
tutajifunza wakati wa kozi, na

00:01:28.520 --> 00:01:32.560
ya kwanza kati yao ni keyword ya repeat.

00:01:32.580 --> 00:01:35.540
Keyword ya repeat inafanya kwa hakika yale niliyoyasema hapo juu.

00:01:36.100 --> 00:01:40.580
Inamwambia Jiki: "Rudia idadi hii ya mara kitu chochote

00:01:40.700 --> 00:01:42.990
nitakachosema kinachofuata." Hebu tuangalie

00:01:43.080 --> 00:01:45.960
msimbo huu. Kwanza kabisa, tutatumia

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:48.440
keyword ya repeat kumwambia Jiki kwamba atafanya

00:01:48.480 --> 00:01:51.580
jambo fulani mara nyingi. Kisha tunaweka

00:01:51.680 --> 00:01:53.940
ni mara ngapi unataka Jiki

00:01:53.980 --> 00:01:57.070
arudie jambo hilo ndani ya mabano ya duara, na kisha

00:01:57.100 --> 00:02:00.030
tunakuwa na mabano haya yaliyopinda, haya yenye mikunjo, na

00:02:00.040 --> 00:02:02.850
ndani ya mabano hayo yaliyopinda ndiyo yale

00:02:02.860 --> 00:02:06.020
tunayotaka Jiki ayarudie. Sasa, mtindo huu

00:02:06.100 --> 00:02:09.320
umeenea sana katika kupanga programu. Tunabainisha

00:02:09.380 --> 00:02:12.400
keyword, kwa kawaida ikiwa na taarifa fulani kama vile

00:02:12.440 --> 00:02:14.549
idadi ya mara ya kufanya jambo fulani katika

00:02:14.580 --> 00:02:17.620
kesi hii, na kisha kizuizi cha msimbo ndani ya

00:02:17.680 --> 00:02:20.880
mabano yaliyopinda. Tukirudi kwenye ulimwengu wa labirinthi,

00:02:21.520 --> 00:02:25.220
badala ya kuandika move, move, move, move,

00:02:25.260 --> 00:02:30.580
tunaweza kuandika repeat mara nne kisha move. Jiki

00:02:30.590 --> 00:02:32.860
ataona msimbo huo na atatumia

00:02:32.940 --> 00:02:36.870
mashine ya move mara nne mfululizo. Na

00:02:36.900 --> 00:02:38.960
hatulazimiki kuweka kitu kimoja tu

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.800
ndani ya mabano hayo yaliyopinda. Jiki anaweza

00:02:41.900 --> 00:02:45.320
kufanya mambo kadhaa kwa kurudia. Tunaweza kumwambia Jiki

00:02:45.460 --> 00:02:48.080
afanye move, kisha turnLeft, na kurudia

00:02:48.120 --> 00:02:51.540
yote hayo mara nne. Jiki akiona

00:02:51.560 --> 00:02:54.000
hivi, atatumia mashine ya move, kisha

00:02:54.060 --> 00:02:56.880
mashine ya turnLeft, kisha mashine ya move, kisha

00:02:56.920 --> 00:02:59.340
mashine ya turnLeft, kisha mashine ya move,

00:02:59.430 --> 00:03:01.720
na kadhalika, hadi atakapomaliza zote mbili

00:03:01.800 --> 00:03:07.160
mara nne. Tunaita maagizo haya ya kurudia vitanzi,

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:09.540
na kuna vitanzi vingi tofauti

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:11.980
tunavyoweza kutumia ambavyo hufanya kazi kwa namna tofauti kidogo.

00:03:12.000 --> 00:03:15.210
Tutavichunguza vyote katika kozi hii. Sasa,

00:03:15.220 --> 00:03:17.710
kuna jambo moja zaidi la kujua, nalo

00:03:17.760 --> 00:03:20.300
ni kwamba kuweka msimbo wako nadhifu na safi

00:03:20.480 --> 00:03:24.240
inakuwa lazima unapofanya kazi na vitanzi. Unapokuwa

00:03:24.280 --> 00:03:26.800
na muundo mzuri wa kuona kwenye msimbo wako,

00:03:26.860 --> 00:03:28.940
inarahisisha sana kuona kinachotokea.

00:03:29.660 --> 00:03:31.740
Lakini kama huna, kama utasahau

00:03:31.780 --> 00:03:34.400
kuacha nafasi vizuri au utachanganya nafasi

00:03:34.460 --> 00:03:38.630
zako, mambo yanachanganya haraka sana. Kwa hiyo

00:03:38.660 --> 00:03:41.500
katika kozi hii, kila wakati tuna kanuni.

00:03:41.600 --> 00:03:45.049
Kila wakati unaweka mabano ya kufungua yaliyopinda

00:03:45.080 --> 00:03:48.430
kwenye mstari huo huo na amri ya repeat.

00:03:48.430 --> 00:03:50.860
Kila wakati unaweka mabano ya kufunga yaliyopinda

00:03:50.940 --> 00:03:54.080
kwenye mstari wake wenyewe baada ya amri, na kila wakati

00:03:54.120 --> 00:03:56.399
unaacha nafasi mbili mwanzoni mwa msimbo

00:03:56.480 --> 00:04:00.120
ulio kati yao. Kwa njia hiyo kila kitu kitabaki nadhifu,

00:04:01.020 --> 00:04:02.560
na kama utasahau au utajaribu kufuata

00:04:02.620 --> 00:04:04.360
mtindo mwingine, utapata hitilafu.

00:04:06.100 --> 00:04:08.080
Katika mazoezi machache yajayo, lengo lako ni

00:04:08.120 --> 00:04:11.060
kutatua baadhi ya changamoto ukitumia

00:04:11.100 --> 00:04:13.720
mistari michache ya msimbo kadiri iwezekanavyo, na

00:04:13.780 --> 00:04:15.320
unaweza kutumia vitanzi vya repeat kukusaidia

00:04:15.380 --> 00:04:18.060
katika hilo. Kisha tutachunguza jinsi ya kuanza

00:04:18.070 --> 00:04:19.990
kutumia kitanzi cha repeat pamoja na

00:04:20.019 --> 00:04:23.270
dhana nyingine ili tuanze kuona mbinu zenye

00:04:23.320 --> 00:04:25.540
nguvu zaidi. Furahia, na tutaonana

00:04:25.580 --> 00:04:26.039
hapa tena hivi karibuni.
